<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ September qtr PPI inputs, outputs both rise.</title>
<headline>NZ September qtr PPI inputs, outputs both rise.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand on Tuesday released the following data on the Producers Price Index for the September quarter (percentage change):</p>
<p>		  Sept 1996 qtr     June 1996 qtr    Sept 1995 qtr</p>
<p>Inputs index     +0.2		-0.2		    +0.3</p>
<p>Outputs index    +0.4		-0.2		    +0.3</p>
<p>		Yr-end Sept 1996  Yr-end Jun 1996  Yr-end Sept 1995</p>
<p>Inputs index     +0.4		+0.5		    +0.6</p>
<p>Outputs index    +0.5		+0.4		    +1.3</p>
<p>The PPI measures the average level of industrial input prices (excluding labour) and output prices.  </p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
